= Instructions

Add the @Bourbon whiskey{1 1/4 oz}, @Elderflower liqueur{3/4 oz}, and freshly squeezed @Lemon juice{1/2 oz} 
in a #Collins glass{} filled with @Ice{}.

Top it off with @Ginger beer{3-5 oz}.

Garnish with @Bitters{8 dashes}.

Serve with a straw and enjoy.